%% TRIP-017 Charter chatbot Agneta
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor presses Fråga Agneta] --> B[Chat dialog, focus in the field]
    B --> C{Question blank?}
    C -- yes --> B
    C -- no --> D["POST /api/chat with the last 6 messages (R7)"]
    D --> E{"Valid? at most 500 characters, alternating, ends with a question (R8)"}
    E -- no --> X[400, chat shows Agneta's error message]
    E -- yes --> F{"Over 10 questions in 5 minutes? (R8)"}
    F -- yes --> G[429 with Retry-After, chat says how long to wait]
    F -- no --> H["Build the system prompt from the database (R1)"]
    H --> I["Messages API: claude-sonnet-5-5, cache_control, max_tokens 600 (R6)"]
    I --> J{Answer?}
    J -- fails, slow, refusal, empty --> X
    J -- text --> K[Chat shows Agneta's answer, usage is logged]
    K --> B
    X --> B
    G --> B
